ue:m036-0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"侍醫遂","kind":"person","person_id":"flg_pi3_zdp","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:p036","chapter_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m036-0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"遂","kind":"person","person_id":"flg_pi3_zdp","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:p036","chapter_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m036-0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"遂","kind":"person","person_id":"flg_pi3_zdp","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:p036","chapter_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m036-0093","start":93,"end":94,"surface":"遂","kind":"person","person_id":"flg_pi3_zdp","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:p036","chapter_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji105-013","person_id":"flg_pi3_zdp","title":"侍醫","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque","source_id":"s-shiji-105-bianque","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:p036","quote":"齊王侍醫遂病，自練五石服之。臣意往過之，遂謂意曰：「不肖有病，幸診遂也。」臣意即診之，告曰：「公病中熱。論曰『中熱不溲者，不可服五石』。石之為藥精悍，公服之不得數溲，亟勿服。色將發臃。」遂曰：「扁鵲曰『陰石以治陰病，陽石以治陽病』。夫藥石者有陰陽水火之齊，故中熱，即為陰石柔齊治之；中寒，即為陽石剛齊治之。」臣意曰：「公所論遠矣。扁鵲雖言若是，然必審診，起度量，立規矩，稱權衡，合色脈表裏有餘不足順逆之法，參其人動靜與息相應，乃可以論。論曰『陽疾處內，陰形應外者，不加悍藥及鑱石』。夫悍藥入中，則邪氣辟矣，而宛氣愈深。診法曰『二陰應外，一陽接內者，不可以剛藥』。剛藥入則動陽，陰病益衰，陽病益箸，邪氣流行，為重困於俞，忿發為疽。」意告之後百餘日，果為疽發乳上，入缺盆，死。此謂論之大體也，必有經紀。拙工有一不習，文理陰陽失矣。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji105-013:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:p036","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"侍醫","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m036-0002","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"保存原文用稱；唐安除為齊王侍醫記任命事件，其餘不以用稱推定任期起點。不以死亡補終點。王禹與高期依並列語法共繫太醫，陽虛侯相與家丞是官職而非本人封侯。","reviewer":"Cod